{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32911","headline":"立春一日江村偶兴 · 李郢","name":"立春一日江村偶兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧历年光看卷尽，立春何用更相催。\n江边野店寒无色，竹外孤村坐见梅。\n山雪乍晴岚翠起，渔家向晚笛声哀。\n南州近有秦中使，闻道胡兵索战来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}